## ⚠️ Challenges

The team faced several development and integration challenges during Sprint 3.

These included:

- Connecting Seller Dashboard information with backend data.
- Ensuring listing updates were saved correctly.
- Managing product status changes.
- Integrating the Save Clothes functionality.
- Connecting buyer messages with the correct sellers and listings.
- Maintaining data consistency across the system.

These issues were addressed through debugging, testing, and coordination between the developers.

No major unresolved blockers remained at the end of the Sprint.

